\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Middle East Turmoil May Spark Emerging-Market  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Siva Sithraputhran Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Februar 2011\par 03:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LONDON (Dow Jones)--Central banks in emerging markets look more and more likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets as heightened nerves over the intensifying political crisis in the Middle East and North Africa cause a broad-based rush out of risky bets Tuesday, with a wide range of emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  taking a hit.\par \par \uc2 Markets largely shrugged off the ructions in Tunisia, and showed relatively mild nerves over the overthrow of the Egyptian regime. But as the Libyan protests draw increasingly violent crackdowns from the under-pressure regime, investors are taking fright.\par \par \uc2 The sell-off Tuesday is indiscriminate, hitting \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Eastern Europe, South Africa, Turkey and Israel. Analysts agree that unless this proves to be a short-term blip, authorities across the region could launch \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilize their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 '\b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2  may suffer, given its oil dependency and regional proximity. As the Turkish lira is now relatively cheap to [sell], we might need to see \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reduce volatility,' said Charles Robertson, head of macro strategy at Renaissance Capital.\par \par \uc2 For now, the spell of emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness is marked, but not panicky. At 1027 GMT, the Turkish lira was at TRY1.6004 against the dollar, just off its weakest level since the end of January. The South African rand was at ZAR7.2057, around its weakest level since Feb. 17, and the Israeli shekel was at ILS3.898, around its weakest in a week.\par \par \uc2 Investors are scaling back on the riskier assets they hold and markets as far away as Korea and Taiwan could be hit, especially as both are energy importers, Robertson at Renaissance Capital said, adding that India, Kenya and Asia may also be affected.\par \par \uc2 Any sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness would push up import prices, stoking inflation--another factor that could provoke \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the region.\par \par \uc2 To be sure, a short blast of weakness would probably be welcomed. It may be 'welcome relief' from recent \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength and such a fall could be 'healthy corrections,' said Werner Gey Van Pittius, an emerging-markets fund manager at \uc2 Investec Asset Management\uc2  in London.\par \par \uc2 But large, abrupt or sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slides would be a different matter, Gey Van Pittius added. 'Central banks may have to act so that they can step away from imported inflation,' he said, referring to the inflationary impact of weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which boost import prices.\par \par \uc2 The market's immediate concerns are on how far the political troubles will spread into oil-producing territories. There are already hints of trouble in Iran and Algeria. For investors, any sign it spreading to Saudi Arabia will be crucial.\par \par \uc2 'If Libya can overthrow its ruler, markets will assume that any ruler may now look unsafe,' said Renaissance's Robertson.\par \par \uc2 -By Siva Sithraputhran, Dow Jones Newswires;+44-20-7842-9462; siva.sithraputhran@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0-\par \par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011 \uc2 Dow Jones & Company, Inc\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020110224e72n002vl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
