\par\par \b \uc2 Turkish  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Chief: We Have Ability To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In Market\b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 2010\par 11:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if the lira moves to an undesirable level, Governor Durmus Yilmaz said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We have ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if developments on exchange rate side become inappropriate with the economy," Yilmaz said in an interview on state television.\par \par \uc2 The lira moved to 1.5480 against the dollar at 1000 GMT, from 1.5510 on Yilmaz's comments. Like other emerging markets Turkey aims to protect its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and foreign trade balances against rising unreliable short-term speculative portfolio investments, or so called "hot money", as quantitative easing policies of big central banks has sent investors seeking higher yields.\par \par \uc2 The bank cut its benchmark interest rate and raised lira reserve requirements last week in order to curb domestic credit expansion, current accounts deficit and "hot money"' inflows. Turkey aims to prevent excessive appreciation of the lira as it hurts exports.\par \par \uc2 However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not expected to allow the lira to depreciate too much, as this could lead to inflation. Yilmaz stressed that Turkey should not target record high growth rates but sustainable and continuing economic growth.\par \par \uc2 By Erkan Oz, Contributing to Dow Jones Newswires, 0090 530 613 0095 [ 23-12-10 1037GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101223e6cn000jm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
