ever, Turkish exporters complain the overvalued lira is a threat to the economy, citing a large and growing current account deficit as evidence.  \par \par \uc2 -By Elizabeth Price, Dow Jones Newswires; 202-862-9295; Elizabeth.Price@dowjones.com [ 09-03-06 1556GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020060309e2390010q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
