  \par \par \uc2 Under its February borrowing programme, the Treasury targets borrowing of 9.3 billion lira while debt redemptions during the month total 12.4 billion lira.  \par \par \uc2 Borrowing so far this month has amounted to 2.0 billion lira. The Treasury targets borrowing of 5.0 billion lira at two auctions on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-TURKEY-AUCTION-POLL|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|MD  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060223e22k000tz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
