\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 2-Turkish  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars. \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juni 2003\par 15:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL, June 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday, stepping in to buy dollars for lira as the Turkish unit climbed to year highs of around 1,409,000 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The lira  was trading at 1,438,000 to the dollar after the bank acted to buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  The bank says it has no target value for the lira but political pressure is heavy to rein in the strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the sake of exporters. \par \par \uc2  The bank said in a statement that lira liquidity was low and was being further squeezed by expectations of an imbalance this week in Treasury borrowing plans. \par \par \uc2  The Treasury is due to soak up lira through an auction of 392-day papers on Tuesday but will repay 839 trillion lira (around $585 million), the majority of it denominated in euros. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that prospect was causing "excessive volatility". \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the buy side directly today in order to prevent this excessive volatility," the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  It did not say how many dollars it had bought. The bank last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars on May 21. \par \par \uc2  It cut interest rates by three percentage points last week but real yields on Turkish treasury papers are still high and the rate cut did little to stem dollar selling. \par \par \uc2  The bank also bought $60 million at a maximum rate of 1,416,000 in its daily dollar purchase auction on Monday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030609dz6900ps3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
