\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Lira recovers post- \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , zloty firms. \b0\par\par\uc2 513 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 2003\par 11:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, May 22 (Reuters) - The Turkish lira recovered on Thursday, after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  knocked it lower the previous session, while supportive comments from a central banker in Poland helped the zloty firm up. \par \par \uc2  The lira was brought down from 11 month highs against the dollar following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , estimated by dealers to have been worth in the region of $450-$500 million, but resumed its firming trend on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Upward pressure was said to have come from domestic players selling hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings to meet corporate tax payments in lira and from investors looking to tap into the country's high yields. \par \par \uc2  "These flows are more or less done...but there is still an extensive degree of dollarisation in the economy, which means that when local institutions have large lira liabilities to meet their first reaction is to sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Gregory Kronsten, emerging markets analyst at WestLB. \par \par \uc2  Kronsten said that residents' \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposits as a percentage of money supply stood at a relatively high 50-55 percent in \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts said Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may only serve to offer better levels for investors to buy lira, particularly if the International Monetary Fund's latest review passes successfully. \par \par \uc2  An IMF team is currently in Turkey assessing the country's progress on economic reforms tied to a $16 billion loan pact. \par \par \uc2  "If the forthcoming fifth review is completely successfully then I'd expect another rally, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely to have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more often going forward," said Kronsten. \par \par \uc2  The IMF's disbursement of another $500 million loan tranche was likely to be the trigger for the release of U.S. aid, Kronsten said, with portfolio inflows set to pick up on the back of that. \par \par \uc2  In this positive backdrop, the market is also looking for further interest rate cuts from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  By 0930 GMT, the lira traded at 1,476,000 to the dollar on the interbank market, from 1,489,000 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  GRABOWSKI LIFTS ZLOTY The Polish zloty climbed off Wednesday's seven-week lows against the euro, helped by comments from senior central banker Boguslaw Grabowski who said it had scope to gain over the coming months. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Grabowski said he expected the Polish unit to strengthen to 3.5 per dollar\par in a year's time, from current levels around 3.72 and to around 4.15/20 per\par euro from 4.34          .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Robust Polish retail sales numbers were also said to lend support, showing\par an 11 percent year-on-year rise in April, up from 1.7 percent in March.\par Meanwhile, the April jobless rate dipped to 18.4 percent, from 18.7 percent\par the previous month.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We saw some (zloty) buying out of Austria after the retail sales data, but\par interest is fairly low, it's really just orders driving the market at the\par moment," said one London-based trader.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The zloty traded at 4.3406 to the euro  from 4.3678 and at 3.7163 to the\par dollar        from 3.7313.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030522dz5m00jra\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
