\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 3-Turkish cbank says  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to stem lira rise. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Gamze Alarslan \par \uc2 528 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 2003\par 15:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL, May 12 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy dollars for lira on Monday to stem a rise in the lira's value that investors said posed a threat to exports and the balance of payments. \par \par \uc2  While a stronger lira could help Turkey meet a key IMF-backed target of lowering consumer prices (CPI), analysts say the bank was worried about the impact of a strong lira on export revenues, a major source of growth for its frail economy. \par \par \uc2  The lira  was trading at around 1,495,500 to the dollar in the afternoon on the interbank market after it had firmed to 1,492,000 in morning trade, just before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action. It had closed Friday at 1,498,000. \par \par \uc2  "A direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was made today to buy dollars in an effort to arrest the volatility seen in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates," the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The bank's only previous \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars was on December 2 when the lira rose stood at around 1,510,000 after a rally. \par \par \uc2  The lira has soared around 18.5 percent since it hit a record intraday low of some 1,772,000 to the dollar on March 24 amid fears for the impact of war in neighbour Iraq on Turkey's economy, tentatively recovering from a deep slump. \par \par \uc2  Some analysts say the lira is over-valued at current rates. Once its value has stabilised, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would likely want to see a steady decline in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's value at a pace roughly in line with future rates of monthly inflation, they say. \par \par \uc2  "Every one of us was getting concerned about the value of the lira. Although (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) says the level of the lira was not the main reason for the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...I think the bank is not happy with a level below 1,500,000 now," said Yarkin Cebeci at JPMorgan. \par \par \uc2  Turkey's foreign trade deficit jumped 74.6 percent in the first quarter of the year to $4.08 billion. The March deficit soared 98.7 percent year-on-year to $1.868 billion as imports rose 44.8 percent and exports 27.3 percent. \par \par \uc2  "The breathless appreciation of the lira would be a concern for a widening current account deficit. Such an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was rational," Cebeci said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently began daily dollar purchase auctions of $20 million for lira in a move it says is designed to boost its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  While attracting healthy demand from investors looking to sell dollars for lira, the auctions have done little to arrest the rising trend in the value of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on December 24, but on that occasion to buy lira when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded at 1,700,000 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The lira is now some 54 percent below the level it stood at just before it was floated amid a February 2001 financial crisis. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030512dz5c00gzo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
