\par\par \b \uc2  Turk cenbank reserves fall $380 mln to $27.454 bln. \b0\par\par\uc2 133 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 13:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ANKARA, March 20 (Reuters) - Turkey's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell by $380 million to $27.454 billion in the week ending March 14. \par \par \uc2  The bank also said on Thursday it could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to soak up excess liquidity if war in neighbouring Iraq threatens the stability of the Turkish lira \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , key to meeting a target of reducing inflation. \par \par \uc2  Total gross reserves stood at $39.482 billion on February 28, the latest available data, of which $27.698 billion was held by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The remainder was held by banks and other non-interest institutions. \par \par \uc2  Gold reserves were unchanged at $1.279 billion, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in its weekly report. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030321dz3k00bld\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Turkey near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance o